    "preamble": "Ashok Kumar Upadhyay vs State on 30 October, 2017",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "It is argued by learned counsel that petitioner has been falsely implicated in the matter. Learned counsel has further submitted that the entire proceedings undertaken by police in the matter is wholly without jurisdiction and dehors Sections 41, 42 & 47 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Per contra, learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the bail application of petitioner.",
